task ACCEPT_LIMITED_PLUGIN_DISTRIBUTION STAGE_LIFECYCLE_ACCEPTED -> LIMITED_PLUGIN_ACCEPTED:
  title "Accept the limited-distribution Plugin entry"
  description "Prepare and test the existing llmthink Plugin through a local or repository marketplace for the operator and later named trial users. Keep the operator test installation usable across exercises. Verify the manifest, Skills, hosted MCP connection, OAuth onboarding guidance, exact install and removal instructions, compatibility, and server-enforced authorization without submitting to the Universal Plugin Directory. Treat limited Plugin and credential delivery as operational admission, not a cryptographic invitation gate; before another person is admitted, require a dedicated per-user credential or accepted OAuth identity. Logo, screenshots, public listing copy, public submission, and general discovery are not launch requirements for this limited trial."
