  description "Complete and verify end-user OAuth client interoperability for the limited Plugin, exact WorkOS subject-to-account mapping, revocation, and fail-closed denial without sharing the operator static bearer token. Reuse accepted implementation evidence from the OAuth plan; do not invite a participant or change public availability."
