  criterion EXACT_ARTIFACT required artifact "A named participant can obtain the exact accepted Plugin revision through the approved non-public source"
  criterion INTEGRITY_AND_COMPATIBILITY required test "Artifact integrity supported client version clean install update and removal are verified"
  criterion NONPUBLIC_SCOPE required artifact "Distribution evidence proves no Universal Directory submission general discovery or public registration change"

milestone_criterion_set LIMITED_ENROLLMENT_PACKAGE_R1:
